OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after stone thrown at
OL,4,Apolice vehicle on M1
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have issued a warning after one
OL,7,Fof their vehicles was hit by a stone
OL,8,Fthrown by a youth from a footbridge
OL,9,Fbridge over the M1.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Police said the vehicle was
OL,12,Fstruck just before 15:00 GMT on
OL,13,FSaturday while travelling in the
OL,14,Foutside lane at about 70mph (113km/h).
OL,15,FThe force has not said exactly where
OL,16,Falong the M1 the stone was thrown.
OL,18,FNo-one was injured, but the windscreen
OL,19,Fwas damaged and the vehicle was taken
OL,20,Foff the road for repairs.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
