OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after stone thrown at
OL,4,Apolice vehicle on M1
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said throwing objects was
OL,7,F"reckless and criminal behaviour" and
OL,8,Fcould "cost someone their life".
